            </div>\r\n              </article>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </section>\r\n          <header class="activity-other-heading"><span>함께 쌓는 경험</span><h3>기타 활동</h3></header>\r\n          <div class="activity-gallery" role="region" aria-label="활동 사진 갤러리" aria-roledescription="사진 갤러리">\r\n            <div class="activity-gallery-filters" role="group" aria-label="활동 분류" hidden><button type="button" data-gallery-category="orientation" aria-pressed="true" aria-label="오리엔테이션">오리엔테이션 <span aria-hidden="true">3</span></button><button type="button" data-gallery-category="lecture" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="특강">특강 <span aria-hidden="true">3</span></button><button type="button" data-gallery-category="field" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="현장학습">현장학습 <span aria-hidden="true">3</span></button><button type="button" data-gallery-category="jobfair" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="취업박람회">취업박람회 <span aria-hidden="true">3</span></button><button type="button" data-gallery-category="graduation" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="수료식">수료식 <span aria-hidden="true">3</span></button></div>\r\n            <div class="activity-gallery-viewport">\r\n              <div class="activity-gallery-stage">\r\n              <figure class="activity-gallery-slide export-style-25" data-category="orientation" data-title="오리엔테이션 · 팀 활동" data-description="팀원들과 의견을 나누며 함께 배울 준비를 해요."><div class="activity-gallery-photo"><img src="assets/activities/orientation-teamwork.png" alt="오리엔테이션에서 노트북을 보며 함께 활동하는 교육생들" width="1007" height="752" loading="lazy" decoding="async" draggable="false"></div><figcaption>오리엔테이션 · 팀 활동</figcaption></figure>\r\n              <figure class="activity-gallery-slide export-style-26" data-category="orientation" data-title="7기 입교식 · 단체사진" data-description="새로 만난 동료들과 교육의 시작을 기념해요."><div class="activity-gallery-photo"><img src="assets/activities/orientation-group-photo.png" alt="인공지능사관학교 7기 입교식 및 오리엔테이션 단체 기념사진" width="1343" height="760" loading="lazy" decoding="async" draggable="false"></div><figcaption>7기 입교식 · 단체사진</figcaption></figure>\r\n              <figure class="activity-gallery-slide export-style-27" data-category="orientation" data-title="오리엔테이션 · 소통 시간" data-description="동료들과 인사를 나누고 학교생활 이야기를 함께 나눠요."><div class="activity-gallery-photo"><img src="assets/activities/orientation-conversation.png" alt="오리엔테이션에서 테이블에 둘러앉아 대화를 나누는 교육생들" width="1011" height="757" loading="lazy" decoding="async" draggable="false"></div><figcaption>오리엔테이션 · 소통 시간</figcaption></figure>\r\n              <figure class="activity-gallery-slide" data-category="lecture" data-title="네이버클라우드 AI 특강" data-description="디지털 전환을 넘어 AI 시대로, 현직자의 이야기를 들어요."><div class="activity-gallery-photo"><img src="assets/activities/guest-lecture-naver-retouched.png" alt="네이버클라우드 AI 특강에서 강연하는 강사와 교육생들" width="1672" height="941" loading="lazy" decoding="async" draggable="false"></div><figcaption>네이버클라우드 AI 특강</figcaption></figure>\r\n              <figure class="activity-gallery-slide" data-category="lecture" data-title="AIPLUS 생성형 AI 특강" data-description="생성형 AI를 어떻게 바라보고 활용할지 함께 생각해 봐요."><div class="activity-gallery-photo"><img src="assets/activities/lecture-aiplus-retouched.png" alt="AIPLUS 행사에서 생성형 AI에 대해 강연하는 강사와 교육생들" width="1672" height="941" loading="lazy" decoding="async" draggable="false"></div><figcaption>AIPLUS 생성형 AI 특강</figcaption></figure>\r\n              <figure class="activity-gallery-slide" data-category="lecture" data-title="AI 서비스 실무 특강" data-description="현직자의 시연을 보며, AI 기술을 서비스에 적용하는 방법을 살펴봐요."><div class="activity-gallery-photo"><img src="assets/activities/lecture-practice-demo.png" alt="AI 서비스 시연을 진행하는 강사와 강연을 듣는 참가자들" width="1672" height="941" loading="lazy" decoding="async" draggable="false"></div><figcaption>AI 서비스 실무 특강</figcaption></figure>\r\n              <figure class="activity-gallery-slide export-style-28" data-category="field" data-title="네이버 기업탐방 · 현장 이야기" data-description="기업을 직접 찾아가 현장에서 일하는 사람들의 이야기를 들어요."><div class="activity-gallery-photo"><img src="assets/activities/visit-naver-room-retouched.png" alt="네이버 기업탐방에서 실무자의 설명을 듣는 교육생들" width="1672" height="940" loading="lazy" decoding="async" draggable="false"></div><figcaption>네이버 기업탐방 · 현장 이야기</figcaption></figure>\r\n              <figure class="activity-gallery-slide export-style-29" data-category="field" data-title="AICON 행사" data-description="AI 행사에 참여해 새로운 기술과 다양한 현장 이야기를 접해요."><div class="activity-gallery-photo"><img src="assets/activities/field-aicon-retouched.png" alt="AICON 행사장 무대와 강연을 듣는 참석자들" width="1672" height="941" loading="lazy" decoding="async" draggable="false"></div><figcaption>AICON 행사</figcaption></figure>\r\n              <figure class="activity-gallery-slide" data-category="field" data-title="AI 프론티어 챌린지 해커톤" data-description="함께 기획하고 개발하며, 팀의 아이디어를 프로젝트로 완성해요."><div class="activity-gallery-photo"><img src="assets/activities/hackathon-scene-retouched.png" alt="인공지능사관학교 6기 AI 프론티어 챌린지 해커톤에서 프로젝트를 만드는 팀들" width="1672" height="941" loading="lazy" decoding="async" draggable="false"></div><figcaption>AI 프론티어 챌린지 해커톤</figcaption></figure>\r\n              <figure class="activity-gallery-slide" data-category="jobfair" data-title="기업 담당자와의 채용 상담" data-description="관심 있는 직무를 이야기하고, 기업이 찾는 역량을 알아봐요."><div class="activity-gallery-photo"><img src="assets/activities/jobfair-consultation-demo.png" alt="취업박람회 상담 테이블에서 채용 담당자와 대화하는 참가자들" width="1672" height="941" loading="lazy" decoding="async" draggable="false"></div><figcaption>기업 담당자와의 채용 상담</figcaption></figure>\r\n              <figure class="activity-gallery-slide" data-category="jobfair" data-title="프로젝트와 포트폴리오 상담" data-description="직접 만든 프로젝트를 소개하고, 다음 준비에 도움이 될 피드백을 받아요."><div class="activity-gallery-photo"><img src="assets/activities/jobfair-portfolio-demo.png" alt="노트북으로 프로젝트 포트폴리오를 검토하는 채용 담당자와 참가자들" width="1672" height="941" loading="lazy" decoding="async" draggable="false"></div><figcaption>프로젝트와 포트폴리오 상담</figcaption></figure>\r\n              <figure class="activity-gallery-slide" data-category="jobfair" data-title="다음 도전을 위한 기업과의 만남" data-description="여러 기업을 만나 보며, 나에게 맞는 기회를 찾아봐요."><div class="activity-gallery-photo"><img src="assets/activities/jobfair-meeting-demo.png" alt="여러 상담 테이블에서 기업 관계자와 만나는 취업박람회 참가자들" width="1672" height="941" loading="lazy" decoding="async" draggable="false"></div><figcaption>다음 도전을 위한 기업과의 만남</figcaption></figure>\r\n              <figure class="activity-gallery-slide export-style-30" data-category="graduation" data-title="수료식 · 함께 남긴 기념사진" data-description="함께 배우고 만든 시간을 돌아보며, 다음 도전을 응원해요."><div class="activity-gallery-photo activity-gallery-photo--graduation"><img src="assets/activities/graduation-group-photo.png" alt="인공지능사관학교 성과발표회 및 수료식 무대에서 함께 촬영한 단체 기념사진" width="1131" height="752" loading="lazy" decoding="async" draggable="false"></div><figcaption>수료식 · 함께 남긴 기념사진</figcaption></figure>\r\n              <figure class="activity-gallery-slide" data-category="graduation" data-title="수료증을 받는 순간" data-description="그동안 쌓은 경험을 돌아보고, 새로운 출발을 함께 축하해요."><div class="activity-gallery-photo"><img src="assets/activities/graduation-certificate-demo.png" alt="수료식 무대에서 수료증을 전달받는 교육생" width="1672" height="941" loading="lazy" decoding="async" draggable="false"></div><figcaption>수료증을 받는 순간</figcaption></figure>\r\n              <figure class="activity-gallery-slide" data-category="graduation" data-title="팀 프로젝트 성과 발표" data-description="팀이 만든 결과를 소개하고, 서로의 배움을 나눠요."><div class="activity-gallery-photo"><img src="assets/activities/graduation-showcase-demo.png" alt="수료 행사 무대에서 팀 프로젝트 결과를 발표하는 참가자들" width="1672" height="941" loading="lazy" decoding="async" draggable="false"></div><figcaption>팀 프로젝트 성과 발표</figcaption></figure>\r\n                <div class="activity-gallery-arrows" hidden><button type="button" class="activity-gallery-arrow activity-gallery-arrow--prev" data-gallery-direction="-1" aria-label="이전 활동 사진"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m14 5-7 7 7 7"/></svg></button><button type="button" class="activity-gallery-arrow activity-gallery-arrow--next" data-gallery-direction="1" aria-label="다음 활동 사진"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m10 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></button></div>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class="activity-gallery-info" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" hidden><span class="activity-gallery-category">오리엔테이션</span><strong class="activity-gallery-caption">오리엔테이션 · 팀 활동</strong><p class="activity-gallery-description">팀원들과 의견을 나누며 함께 배울 준비를 해요.</p></div>\r\n            <div class="activity-gallery-pagination" hidden><div class="activity-gallery-dots" role="group" aria-label="사진 선택"></div></div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </section>\r\n      <section id="career" class="career-guide" aria-labelledby="career-heading">\r\n        <div class="about-wrap">\r\n          <div class="career-guide-heading"><h2 id="career-heading">취업과 창업 준비도 함께해요.</h2><p>수료 후에도 취·창업 현황을 꾸준히 살피고, 개별 상담과 맞춤형 후속 프로그램으로 다음 도전을 지원해요.</p></div>\r\n          <ol class="career-guide-cards" aria-label="단계별 취업·창업 지원">\r\n            <li class="career-stage-card">\r\n              <div class="career-stage-copy"><span class="career-stage-label">교육 중</span><h3>실전처럼 연습하는<br>모의면접</h3><p>실제 면접처럼 답변을 연습하고, 면접관의 피드백으로 나의 강점과 보완할 점을 알아봐요.</p></div>\r\n              <div class="career-stage-media"><img src="assets/career/mock-interview-retouched.png" alt="교육생들이 면접관 앞에 앉아 모의면접을 진행하는 모습" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>\r\n            </li>\r\n            <li class="career-stage-card">\r\n              <div class="career-stage-copy"><span class="career-stage-label">수료 전·직후</span><h3>이력서·포트폴리오<br>컨설팅</h3><p>지원할 직무에 맞춰 이력서를 다듬고, 프로젝트 경험이 잘 드러나도록 포트폴리오를 함께 점검해요.</p></div>\r\n              <div class="career-stage-media"><img src="assets/activities/jobfair-portfolio-demo.png" alt="노트북의 프로젝트 포트폴리오를 함께 살펴보며 상담하는 모습" width="1672" height="941" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>\r\n            </li>\r\n            <li class="career-stage-card">\r\n              <div class="career-stage-copy"><span class="career-stage-label">수료 후</span><h3>카카오톡으로 이어지는<br>취·창업 라운지</h3><p>수료 후에도 카카오톡 채널에서 취·창업 소식을 이어서 확인해요. ‘인공지능사관학교 취창업라운지’를 찾아보세요.</p></div>\r\n              <div class="career-stage-media career-stage-media--channel" aria-label="카카오톡 인공지능사관학교 취창업라운지 채널 안내">\r\n                <div class="career-channel-top"><span class="career-channel-brand"><span class="career-channel-mark" aria-hidden="true">Ch</span>카카오톡 채널</span><span class="career-channel-note">수료 후에도 함께</span></div>\r\n                <div class="career-channel-profile"><span class="career-channel-avatar" role="img" aria-label="첨부 사진의 인공지능사관학교 취창업라운지 채널 로고"></span><div class="career-channel-name"><span>인공지능사관학교</span><strong>취창업라운지</strong></div></div>\r\n                <span class="career-channel-footer">취업과 창업, 다음 소식을 만나보세요.</span>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </li>\r\n          </ol>\r\n          <section class="career-programs" aria-labelledby="career-programs-heading">\r\n            <header class="career-programs-heading"><span>수료생 후속 프로그램</span><h3 id="career-programs-heading">현장 경험과 창업을 지원해요.</h3></header>\r\n            <div class="career-program-grid">\r\n              <article class="career-program-card career-program-card--intern" aria-labelledby="ax-internship-heading">\r\n                <header><span class="career-program-label">2026년 · 취업 연계</span><h4 id="ax-internship-heading">AX 인턴십 프로그램</h4><p class="career-program-summary">수료생과 지역 AX 기업을 연결해 현장 경험을 쌓고, 지역 취업으로 이어질 수 있도록 도와요.</p></header>\r\n                <div class="career-program-funding">\r\n                  <div><span>1인당 월 최대 인건비 지원</span><strong>240<small>만원</small></strong></div>\r\n                  <p><b>최대 6개월</b><span>현장 경험을 지원해요</span></p>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class="career-program-detail"><h5>누가 참여하나요?</h5><dl class="career-program-targets"><div><dt>수료생</dt><dd>AX 직무 경험과 취업을 희망하는 수료생</dd></div><div><dt>기업</dt><dd>채용 계획이 있는 관내 AX 기업<br><span>상시근로자 5인 이상</span></dd></div></dl></div>\r\n                <div class="career-program-detail"><h5>이렇게 지원해요</h5><ul class="career-program-benefits"><li>희망 직무와 기업 수요에 맞춰 연결해요.</li><li>인건비 지원으로 AX 현장 경험의 기회를 넓혀요.</li></ul></div>\r\n                <p class="career-program-note">사업 일정에 따라 지원 기간이 달라질 수 있어요.</p>\r\n              </article>\r\n              <article class="career-program-card career-program-card--startup" aria-labelledby="ai-startup-heading">\r\n                <header><span class="career-program-label">AI 분야 · 창업 지원</span><h4 id="ai-startup-heading">AI 특화 창업 프로그램</h4><p class="career-program-summary">AI 창업을 준비하거나 사업을 키우는 수료생에게 제작 지원과 맞춤형 멘토링을 연결해요.</p></header>\r\n                <div class="career-program-funding">\r\n                  <div><span>팀당 최대 창업지원금</span><strong>5,000<small>만원</small></strong></div>\r\n                  <p><b>10개 팀 내외</b><span>총 5억원 규모</span></p>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class="career-program-detail"><h5>누가 참여하나요?</h5><dl class="career-program-targets"><div><dt>예비 창업자</dt><dd>광주·전남에서 창업을 희망하는 수료생</dd></div><div><dt>창업 기업</dt><dd>공고일 기준, 수료생이 대표인 업력 7년 이내 기업</dd></div></dl></div>\r\n                <div class="career-program-detail"><h5>이렇게 지원해요</h5><ul class="career-program-benefits"><li>시제품 제작비와 설계·구현 컨설팅을 지원해요.</li><li>아이디어·사업계획을 다듬고, 맞춤형 멘토링을 받아요.</li><li>IR 발표·전시·네트워킹으로 성과를 나눠요.</li></ul></div>\r\n                <p class="career-program-note">우수 성과는 차기 사업 가점 등 후속 지원과 연계될 수 있어요.</p>\r\n              </article>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </section>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n  </main>\r\n  <footer class="site-footer" id="siteFooter" data-note="표지: 콘셉트 이미지 / 본문: 학교 LIVE 기록 사진"></footer>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>\r\n	e4cd891947b7ae55e12b73f98ec962e9e4a4637d	73796	예전 백업 파일	\N	2026-10-13 10:20:52.819191
2	about	<!doctype html>\r\n<html lang="ko" class="scene-still school-about about-has-section-nav" data-menu="about" data-subnav="off" data-theme="light">\r\n<head>\r\n  <meta charset="UTF-8">\r\n  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">\r\n  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">\r\n  <title>인사교 알아보기 — 인공지능사관학교</title>\r\n  <meta name="description" content="인사교 A to Z. 인공지능사관학교의 교육 목적, 교과목과 교육 시간, 활동, 취업·창업 지원을 한 페이지에서 알아보세요.">\r\n  <meta property="og:type" content="website">\r\n  <meta property="og:title" content="인사교 알아보기 — 인공지능사관학교">\r\n  <meta property="og:description" content="인사교 A to Z. 인공지능사관학교의 교육 목적, 교과목과 교육 시간, 활동, 취업·창업 지원을 한 페이지에서 알아보세요.">\r\n  <meta name="theme-color" content="#1C2A4A">\r\n  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="../common/assets/brand/symbol-blue.png">\r\n  <link rel="preload" as="image" href="assets/hero-cap-enlarged-fit-desktop-2x.png" media="(min-width: 901px), (min-width: 601px) and (min-aspect-ratio: 1/1)">\r\n  <link rel="preload" as="image" href="assets/hero-cap-enlarged-fit-mobile-2x.png" media="(max-width: 600px), (min-width: 601px) and (max-width: 900px) and (max-aspect-ratio: 1/1)">\r\n  <link rel="preload" as="font" href="assets/fonts/Pretendard-Black.woff2" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>\r\n  <link rel="preload" as="font" href="assets/fonts/Paperlogy-9Black.woff2" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>\r\n  <link rel="stylesheet" href="../common/css/tokens.css">\r\n  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css?v=20261012-section-rail-short">\r\n  <link rel="stylesheet" href="../common/css/site.css">\r\n  <script src="../common/js/menu.js" defer></script>\r\n  <script src="../common/js/site.js" defer></script>\r\n  <script src="script.js?v=20261012-section-rail-short" defer></script>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n  <header class="site-header" id="siteHeader"></header>\r\n  <nav class="section-navigation" aria-label="인사교 알아보기 페이지 목차">\r\n    <ol class="section-rail">\r\n      <li><a href="#intro" data-section aria-current="location"><span class="section-rail-label">인사교 소개</span></a></li>\r\n      <li><a href="#learning" data-section><span class="section-rail-label">무엇을 배우나요?</span></a></li>\r\n      <li><a href="#activities" data-section><span class="section-rail-label">어떤 활동을 하나요?</span></a></li>\r\n      <li><a href="#career" data-section><span class="section-rail-label">취업·창업 지원</span></a></li>\r\n    </ol>\r\n  </nav>\r\n  <main id="main" tabindex="-1">\r\n    <div class="scene-runway">\r\n      <section class="immersive-hero" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">\r\n        <div class="scene-background" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="scene-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>\r\n        <div class="hero-masthead"><span>LEARN DEEPLY. BUILD YOUR NEXT.</span><h1 id="hero-heading">인공지능사관학교</h1></div>\r\n        <div class="scene-copy"><span class="eyebrow">인사교 알아보기 / A TO Z</span><h2>AI를 배우고,<br>실전 경험을 쌓아요.</h2><p>교육과 기업 연계 프로젝트부터<br>다양한 활동, 취·창업 지원까지 알아봐요.</p></div>\r\n        <a href="#learning" class="glass-note"><span class="eyebrow">MADE IN GWANGJU.</span><strong>깊이 배우고.<br>함께 만들고.<br>더 멀리 나아가요.</strong><div><span>기초 학습부터 실전 프로젝트까지<br>교육 과정 살펴보기</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div></a>\r\n        <a class="scene-scroll" href="#intro"><span class="down-circle" aria-hidden="true">↓</span> 인사교를 알아보세요</a>\r\n      </section>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class="about-paper">\r\n      <section id="intro" class="about-section about-wrap" aria-labelledby="intro-heading">\r\n        <div class="intro-feature">\r\n          <div class="intro-purpose">\r\n            <h2 id="intro-heading">테스트</h2>\r\n            <p class="intro-definition">인사교란? 인공지능사관학교의 줄임말이에요.</p>\r\n            <p>인사교는 <strong>AI를 배우고 직접 만들어 보고 싶은 청년</strong>을 위한 학교예요.fdfdfdfdff</p>\r\n            <p>AI 기초부터 모델링, 서비스 개발, 플랫폼·인프라까지 배우고, <br><strong>직무·산업별 수업</strong>에서 배운 기술을 어떻게 쓰는지 익혀요. <br><strong>기업 연계·실증·창업 프로젝트</strong>로 여러분의 아이디어를 <br><strong>실제로 작동하는 서비스</strong>로 만들어 봐요.</p>\r\n            <p>청년들의 배움이 <strong>실제 일자리로 이어지고</strong>, <br><strong>AI 생태계가 꾸준히 성장하는 것</strong>이 인사교가 꿈꾸는 모습이에요. <br><strong>AI 인재 양성의 중심, 인공지능사관학교</strong>에서 함께해요.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class="intro-news-stack" aria-label="국내 AI 인력 부족과 기업의 AI 인재 수요에 관한 기사">\r\n            <div class="intro-news-motion">\r\n            <div class="intro-news-papers">\r\n            <article class="intro-news-card intro-news-card--learning">\r\n              <div class="intro-news-browserbar" aria-hidden="true"><span class="intro-news-window-controls"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="intro-news-window-address"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6"/><path d="M2 8h12M8 2c-3 3-3 9 0 12M8 2c3 3 3 9 0 12"/></svg><span>포춘코리아</span></span><span class="intro-news-window-menu"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></div>\r\n              <div class="intro-news-body">\r\n                <div class="intro-news-meta"><span>포춘코리아</span><time datetime="2026-04-02">2026/04/02</time></div>\r\n                <div class="intro-news-story"><div class="intro-news-story-copy"><h4>10년 전 알파고 쇼크 때 예견된 <em>AI 인력난, 왜 아직도 부족할까</em></h4><div class="intro-news-print-lines" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><figure class="intro-news-photo"><img src="assets/news/ai-developer-team.png" alt="AI 개발자들이 노트북의 코드와 데이터를 함께 검토하는 모습" width="1448" height="1086" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </article>\r\n            <article class="intro-news-card intro-news-card--career">\r\n              <div class="intro-news-browserbar" aria-hidden="true"><span class="intro-news-window-controls"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="intro-news-window-address"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6"/><path d="M2 8h12M8 2c-3 3-3 9 0 12M8 2c3 3 3 9 0 12"/></svg><span>뉴시스</span></span><span class="intro-news-window-menu"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></div>\r\n              <div class="intro-news-body">\r\n                <div class="intro-news-meta"><span>뉴시스</span><time datetime="2026-09-12">2026/09/12</time></div>\r\n                <h4>대기업 하반기 채용 본격화…“<em>AI 활용한 문제 해결 능력 중시</em>”</h4>\r\n                <div class="intro-news-print-lines" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </article>\r\n            <article class="intro-news-card intro-news-card--project">\r\n              <div class="intro-news-browserbar" aria-hidden="true"><span class="intro-news-window-controls"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="intro-news-window-address"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6"/><path d="M2 8h12M8 2c-3 3-3 9 0 12M8 2c3 3 3 9 0 12"/></svg><span>지디넷코리아</span></span><span class="intro-news-window-menu"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></div>\r\n              <div class="intro-news-body">\r\n                <div class="intro-news-meta"><span>지디넷코리아</span><time datetime="2026-03-23">2026/03/23</time></div>\r\n                <h4>기업 80% 이상 “<em>AI 인재 필요</em>”… ‘AI 박사’ 아닌 ‘<em>데이터 읽는 실무자</em>’ 원해</h4>\r\n                <div class="intro-news-print-lines" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </article>\r\n            </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class="intro-platform" id="education-platform">\r\n          <div class="intro-platform-features">\r\n            <article><img class="platform-icon" src="assets/platform/learning.png" alt="" width="1254" height="1254" loading="lazy"><h4>체계적인 학습 관리</h4><p>수도권·광주 교육기관의 교육 경험을 바탕으로, 스마트 교육 플랫폼에서 학습 과정을 차근차근 관리해요.</p></article>\r\n            <article><img class="platform-icon" src="assets/platform/team-discussion.png" alt="" width="1254" height="1254" loading="lazy"><h4>토론·실습·발표</h4><p>팀원들과 의견을 나누고 직접 실습해요. 배운 내용은 발표하면서 정리해 봐요.</p></article>\r\n            <article><img class="platform-icon" src="assets/platform/curriculum.png" alt="" width="1254" height="1254" loading="lazy"><h4>분야별 실무 교육</h4><p>여러 산업의 문제에 AI를 적용해 봐요. 어떤 문제를 풀지 정하고, 직접 기획하고 만들어 봐요.</p></article>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <section class="cohort-upgrade" id="cohort-upgrade" aria-labelledby="cohort-upgrade-heading">\r\n          <div class="partner-heading"><div><span class="micro-label">더 새로워진 교육</span><h3 id="cohort-upgrade-heading">무엇이 달라졌나요?</h3></div></div>\r\n          <div class="cohort-comparison" role="group" aria-label="6기와 7기 교육 및 지원 비교">\r\n            <article class="cohort-card cohort-card--previous" aria-labelledby="cohort-six-heading">\r\n              <header class="cohort-card-header"><h4 id="cohort-six-heading">6기</h4><span>직군과 기술에 집중</span></header>\r\n              <dl class="cohort-facts">\r\n                <div class="cohort-fact"><dt>교육 설계 방향</dt><dd><strong class="cohort-direction">직군·기술 트랙 중심</strong><ul class="cohort-topics cohort-topics--row" tabindex="0" aria-label="교육 분야"><li aria-label="데이터 기술"><span class="cohort-topic-art"><img src="assets/courses/data-clay.png" alt="" width="1254" height="1254" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="cohort-topic-label">데이터<br>기술</span></li><li aria-label="AI 모델링"><span class="cohort-topic-art"><img src="assets/courses/prototype-clay.png" alt="" width="1254" height="1254" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="cohort-topic-label">AI<br>모델링</span></li><li aria-label="AI 기반 서비스"><span class="cohort-topic-art"><img src="assets/courses/chat-clay.png" alt="" width="1254" height="1254" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="cohort-topic-label">AI 기반<br>서비스</span></li><li aria-label="AI 플랫폼&amp;인프라"><span class="cohort-topic-art"><img src="assets/courses/api-clay.png" alt="" width="1254" height="1254" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="cohort-topic-label">AI 플랫폼<br>&amp;인프라</span></li><li aria-label="AI 비즈니스"><span class="cohort-topic-art"><img src="assets/courses/business-clay.png" alt="" width="1254" height="1254" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="cohort-topic-label">AI<br>비즈니스</span></li></ul></dd></div>\r\n                <div class="cohort-fact"><dt>프로젝트(PBL) 학습</dt><dd class="cohort-value"><strong>520</strong><small>시간</small></dd></div>\r\n                <div class="cohort-fact"><dt>월 교육 지원금</dt><dd class="cohort-value"><strong>30만원</strong><small>/ 월</small></dd></div>\r\n                <div class="cohort-fact"><dt>팀 프로젝트 지원비</dt><dd class="cohort-value"><strong>15만원</strong><small>/ 팀</small></dd></div>\r\n              </dl>\r\n            </article>\r\n            <article class="cohort-card cohort-card--current" aria-labelledby="cohort-seven-heading">\r\n              <header class="cohort-card-header"><h4 id="cohort-seven-heading">7기</h4></header>\r\n              <dl class="cohort-facts">\r\n                <div class="cohort-fact"><dt>교육 설계 방향</dt><dd><strong class="cohort-direction">산업 도메인 중심</strong><ul class="cohort-topics cohort-topics--row" tabindex="0" aria-label="교육 분야"><li aria-label="AI 금융"><span class="cohort-topic-art"><img src="assets/courses/business-clay.png" alt="" width="1254" height="1254" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="cohort-topic-label">AI<br>금융</span></li><li aria-label="AI 피지컬"><span class="cohort-topic-art"><img src="assets/courses/agent-clay.png" alt="" width="1254" height="1254" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="cohort-topic-label">AI<br>피지컬</span></li><li aria-label="AI 헬스케어"><span class="cohort-topic-art"><img src="assets/courses/user-clay.png" alt="" width="1254" height="1254" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="cohort-topic-label">AI<br>헬스케어</span></li><li aria-label="AI 융합"><span class="cohort-topic-art"><img src="assets/courses/prototype-clay.png" alt="" width="1254" height="1254" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="cohort-topic-label">AI<br>융합</span></li><li aria-label="AI 보안"><span class="cohort-topic-art"><svg class="cohort-topic-shield" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><defs><linearGradient id="cohort-shield-blue" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#78caff"/><stop offset=".55" stop-color="#447aff"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#6555d9"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id="cohort-shield-core" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#e6f7ff"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#a8c8ff"/></linearGradient></defs><path d="M32 4c7 6 14 8 23 10v18c0 13-9 22-23 28C18 54 9 45 9 32V14c9-2 16-4 23-10Z" fill="url(#cohort-shield-blue)" stroke="#b4d6ff" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M32 12c6 4 11 6 16 7v13c0 9-6 16-16 21-10-5-16-12-16-21V19c5-1 10-3 16-7Z" fill="url(#cohort-shield-core)"/><rect x="23" y="30" width="18" height="15" rx="4" fill="#3563cf"/><path d="M27 30v-5a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v5" fill="none" stroke="#3563cf" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="32" cy="36" r="2" fill="#fff"/><path d="M32 38v3" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span><span class="cohort-topic-label">AI<br>보안</span></li></ul></dd></div>\r\n                <div class="cohort-fact"><dt>프로젝트 중심 도약과정</dt><dd class="cohort-value"><strong>720<span class="cohort-highlight-unit">시간</span></strong><span class="cohort-rise" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 20V4m-7 7 7-7 7 7"/></svg></span></dd></div>\r\n                <div class="cohort-fact"><dt>월 교육 지원금</dt><dd class="cohort-value"><strong>50<span class="cohort-highlight-unit">만원</span></strong><span class="cohort-rise" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 20V4m-7 7 7-7 7 7"/></svg></span><small>/ 월</small></dd></div>\r\n                <div class="cohort-fact"><dt>팀 프로젝트 지원비 (최대)</dt><dd class="cohort-value"><strong>200<span class="cohort-highlight-unit">만원</span></strong><span class="cohort-rise" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 20V4m-7 7 7-7 7 7"/></svg></span><small>/ 팀</small></dd></div>\r\n              </dl>\r\n            </article>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </section>\r\n        <div class="partner-block" id="partners">\r\n          <div class="partner-heading"><div><span class="micro-label">관련 기관</span><h3>교육에 함께하는 기업과 기관</h3></div></div>\r\n          <div class="partner-network" role="group" aria-label="인공지능사관학교와 함께하는 네 기관">\r\n            <div class="partner-node partner-node-school"><span>인공지능사관학교</span><div class="partner-logo"><img src="assets/partners/ai-school.png" alt="인공지능사관학교" width="278" height="61"></div><p>AI 교육 · 프로젝트 · 취업 지원</p></div>\r\n            <svg class="partner-wires partner-wires-desktop" viewBox="0 0 1000 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M500 0 C500 55 125 40 125 100"/><path d="M500 0 C500 55 375 40 375 100"/><path d="M500 0 C500 55 625 40 625 100"/><path d="M500 0 C500 55 875 40 875 100"/></svg>\r\n            <svg class="partner-wires partner-wires-mobile" viewBox="0 0 1000 452" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M500 0 V152 H250"/><path d="M500 0 V152 H750"/><path d="M500 0 V360 H250"/><path d="M500 0 V360 H750"/></svg>\r\n            <ul class="partner-network-children">\r\n              <li class="partner-node partner-node-est"><div class="partner-logo"><div class="partner-est-wordmark"><img src="assets/partners/estsoft.png" alt="이스트소프트 EST 로고" width="465" height="120" loading="lazy"></div></div><h4>이스트소프트</h4><p>AI 선도기업의<br>실무 기술과 경험</p></li>\r\n              <li class="partner-node partner-node-naver"><div class="partner-logo"><img src="assets/partners/naver-cloud.png" alt="NAVER Cloud 로고" loading="lazy"></div><h4>네이버클라우드</h4><p>AI와 클라우드를<br>연결하는 기술</p></li>\r\n              <li class="partner-node partner-node-smhrd"><div class="partner-logo"><img src="assets/partners/smhrd.svg" alt="스마트인재개발원 로고" width="265" height="38" loading="lazy"></div><h4>스마트인재개발원</h4><p>쌓아 온 교육 경험과<br>취업 지원 노하우</p></li>\r\n              <li class="partner-node partner-node-kosa"><div class="partner-logo"><img src="assets/partners/kosa.png" alt="KOSA 한국인공지능·소프트웨어산업협회 로고" loading="lazy"></div><h4>한국인공지능·<br>소프트웨어산업협회</h4><p>AI·SW 산업의<br>경험과 네트워크</p></li>\r\n            </ul>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <section class="eligibility-panel" id="who-for" aria-labelledby="eligibility-heading">\r\n          <div class="partner-heading eligibility-heading">\r\n            <div><span class="micro-label">지원 대상</span><h3 id="eligibility-heading">어떤 사람에게 적합한지?</h3></div>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class="eligibility-summary">\r\n            <article class="eligibility-condition">\r\n              <span class="eligibility-icon eligibility-icon--calendar" aria-hidden="true"></span>\r\n              <h4>만 18~39세 청년 미취업자</h4>\r\n              <p>전국 어디에서든 지원할 수 있어요.</p>\r\n            </article>\r\n            <article class="eligibility-condition">\r\n              <span class="eligibility-icon eligibility-icon--cap" aria-hidden="true"></span>\r\n              <h4>비전공자·졸업생도 지원 가능</h4>\r\n              <p>전공과 학력에 제한이 없어요.</p>\r\n            </article>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <section class="graduate-stats" aria-labelledby="graduate-stats-heading">\r\n            <header class="graduate-stats-heading">\r\n              <div><span class="graduate-eyebrow">누적 수료</span><h4 id="graduate-stats-heading">함께한 수료생</h4></div>\r\n              <div class="graduate-total education-hours-stat"><span>3~6기 누적 수료</span><strong>1,216<small>명</small></strong></div>\r\n            </header>\r\n            <div class="graduate-grid">\r\n              <article class="graduate-card" aria-labelledby="graduate-cohort-3">\r\n                <h5 id="graduate-cohort-3" class="graduate-cohort">3기</h5>\r\n                <p class="graduate-count"><strong>302</strong><span>명 수료</span></p>\r\n                <div class="graduate-ratio" role="img" aria-label="남자 69.5%, 여자 30.5%" style="--male-ratio:69.5364238410596%"><span class="graduate-ratio-male"></span><span class="graduate-ratio-female"></span></div>\r\n                <dl class="graduate-breakdown">\r\n                  <div class="graduate-male"><dt>남자</dt><dd><strong>210<span>명</span></strong><small>69.5%</small></dd></div>\r\n                  <div class="graduate-female"><dt>여자</dt><dd><strong>92<span>명</span></strong><small>30.5%</small></dd></div>\r\n                </dl>\r\n              </article>\r\n              <article class="graduate-card" aria-labelledby="graduate-cohort-4">\r\n                <h5 id="graduate-cohort-4" class="graduate-cohort">4기</h5>\r\n                <p class="graduate-count"><strong>302</strong><span>명 수료</span></p>\r\n                <div class="graduate-ratio" role="img" aria-label="남자 70.2%, 여자 29.8%" style="--male-ratio:70.19867549668875%"><span class="graduate-ratio-male"></span><span class="graduate-ratio-female"></span></div>\r\n                <dl class="graduate-breakdown">\r\n                  <div class="graduate-male"><dt>남자</dt><dd><strong>212<span>명</span></strong><small>70.2%</small></dd></div>\r\n                  <div class="graduate-female"><dt>여자</dt><dd><strong>90<span>명</span></strong><small>29.8%</small></dd></div>\r\n                </dl>\r\n              </article>\r\n              <article class="graduate-card" aria-labelledby="graduate-cohort-5">\r\n                <h5 id="graduate-cohort-5" class="graduate-cohort">5기</h5>\r\n                <p class="graduate-count"><strong>305</strong><span>명 수료</span></p>\r\n                <div class="graduate-ratio" role="img" aria-label="남자 68.9%, 여자 31.1%" style="--male-ratio:68.85245901639344%"><span class="graduate-ratio-male"></span><span class="graduate-ratio-female"></span></div>\r\n                <dl class="graduate-breakdown">\r\n                  <div class="graduate-male"><dt>남자</dt><dd><strong>210<span>명</span></strong><small>68.9%</small></dd></div>\r\n                  <div class="graduate-female"><dt>여자</dt><dd><strong>95<span>명</span></strong><small>31.1%</small></dd></div>\r\n                </dl>\r\n              </article>\r\n              <article class="graduate-card" aria-labelledby="graduate-cohort-6">\r\n                <h5 id="graduate-cohort-6" class="graduate-cohort">6기</h5>\r\n                <p class="graduate-count"><strong>307</strong><span>명 수료</span></p>\r\n                <div class="graduate-ratio" role="img" aria-label="남자 66.4%, 여자 33.6%" style="--male-ratio:66.44951140065146%"><span class="graduate-ratio-male"></span><span class="graduate-ratio-female"></span></div>\r\n                <dl class="graduate-breakdown">\r\n                  <div class="graduate-male"><dt>남자</dt><dd><strong>204<span>명</span></strong><small>66.4%</small></dd></div>\r\n                  <div class="graduate-female"><dt>여자</dt><dd><strong>103<span>명</span></strong><small>33.6%</small></dd></div>\r\n                </dl>\r\n              </article>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <p class="graduate-stats-note">기수별 전체 수료 인원 기준</p>\r\n          </section>\r\n        </section>\r\n        <section class="why-school-section" id="why-school" aria-labelledby="why-school-heading">\r\n          <header class="why-school-heading"><h3 id="why-school-heading">왜 인사교를 선택해야 할까요?</h3><p>기업이 필요로 하는 AI 직무 역량을 배워요.<br>산업 현장에서 바로 활용할 수 있는 실력을 키워요.</p></header>\r\n          <ul class="why-school-highlights" aria-label="인사교 교육과 지원의 세 가지 강점">\r\n            <li><span class="why-school-highlight-label"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 4h7l2 2 2-2h7v15h-7l-2 2-2-2H3z" fill="#d9e5ff"/><path d="M12 6v15M6 9h3M15 9h3M6 13h3M15 13h3" stroke="#244cd2" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>나의 수준과 목표</span><strong>맞춤형 교육</strong></li>\r\n            <li><span class="why-school-highlight-label"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="8" cy="7" r="3" fill="#244cd2"/><circle cx="17" cy="8" r="2.5" fill="#7c99f5"/><path d="M2 21v-6a6 6 0 0 1 12 0v6zM15 13a5 5 0 0 1 7 4v4h-6" fill="#d9e5ff"/><path d="m6 17 2 2 4-5" fill="none" stroke="#244cd2" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>함께 배우고 만들어요</span><strong>팀 실무 프로젝트</strong></li>\r\n            <li><span class="why-school-highlight-label"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="14" rx="3" fill="#d9e5ff"/><path d="M8 7V3h8v4M2 12h20M9 12v4h6v-4" fill="none" stroke="#244cd2" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>준비 단계에 맞춰</span><strong>취·창업 지원</strong></li>\r\n          </ul>\r\n          <div class="why-school-cards">\r\n            <article class="why-school-card why-school-card--learning">\r\n              <span class="why-school-card-category">나에게 맞는 교육</span><h4>내 수준에 맞게,<br>내 목표에 가깝게</h4><p>지금의 실력과 배우려는 목적에 맞춰 공부해요. 필요한 기초를 다지고, 최신 AI 기술도 유연하게 배워요.</p>\r\n              <div class="why-school-visual why-school-visual--learning" data-learning-step="3" data-learning-route-step="3" aria-hidden="true">\r\n                <div class="why-school-learning-glow"></div>\r\n                <svg class="why-school-learning-route" viewBox="0 0 300 235" preserveAspectRatio="none">\r\n                  <defs><mask id="why-school-learning-progress" maskUnits="userSpaceOnUse" x="0" y="0" width="300" height="235"><path class="why-school-learning-progress" d="M72 40H246Q279 40 279 71V88Q279 112 249 112H68Q28 112 28 147V170Q28 188 54 188" pathLength="100" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="8" stroke-dasharray="100" stroke-dashoffset="100"/></mask></defs>\r\n                  <path d="M72 40H246Q279 40 279 71V88Q279 112 249 112H68Q28 112 28 147V170Q28 188 54 188"/>\r\n                  <path class="why-school-learning-route-flow" d="M72 40H246Q279 40 279 71V88Q279 112 249 112H68Q28 112 28 147V170Q28 188 54 188" mask="url(#why-school-learning-progress)"/>\r\n                </svg>\r\n                <div class="why-school-learning-step why-school-learning-step--basics"><span class="why-school-learning-step-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40"><path d="M4 7h12l4 3 4-3h12v26H24l-4 3-4-3H4Z" fill="#dbe6ff"/><path d="M20 10v26M9 15h6M25 15h6M9 22h6M25 22h6" fill="none" stroke="#557de1" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span><span><b>AI 기초</b><small>차근차근 다져요</small></span><span class="why-school-learning-step-check">✓</span></div>\r\n                <div class="why-school-learning-step why-school-learning-step--practice"><span class="why-school-learning-step-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40"><rect x="3" y="6" width="34" height="28" rx="7" fill="#e8def9"/><path d="m14 14-6 6 6 6m12-12 6 6-6 6m-4-14-4 16" fill="none" stroke="#9b7ac9" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span><b>직무 역량</b><small>필요한 기술을 익혀요</small></span><span class="why-school-learning-step-check">✓</span></div>\r\n                <div class="why-school-learning-step why-school-learning-step--latest"><span class="why-school-learning-step-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40"><path d="m20 4 5 11 11 5-11 5-5 11-5-11-11-5 11-5Z" fill="#c8ebdf"/><path d="m31 3 2 5 5 2-5 2-2 5-2-5-5-2 5-2Z" fill="#64b19a"/></svg></span><span><b>최신 AI 기술</b><small>새로운 기술도 배워요</small></span><span class="why-school-learning-step-check">✓</span></div>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </article>\r\n            <article class="why-school-card why-school-card--project">\r\n              <span class="why-school-card-category">AI 실무 프로젝트</span><h4>팀원과 함께,<br>직접 만드는 AI 서비스</h4><p>팀 프로젝트를 중심으로, 동료에게 배우고 스스로 해답을 찾아봐요. 자율 프로젝트로 관심 있는 주제도 직접 풀어봐요.</p>\r\n              <div class="why-school-visual why-school-visual--mentor" aria-hidden="true">\r\n                <div class="why-school-monitor"><div class="why-school-monitor-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>AI PROJECT / main.py</span></div>\r\n                  <div class="why-school-code-editor">\r\n                    <div class="why-school-code-tabs"><span><i>Py</i> main.py</span><b>•••</b></div>\r\n                    <div class="why-school-code-lines">\r\n                      <div><span class="why-school-code-number">1</span><code><span class="syntax-purple">import</span> numpy <span class="syntax-purple">as</span> np</code></div>\r\n                      <div><span class="why-school-code-number">2</span><code> </code></div>\r\n                      <div><span class="why-school-code-number">3</span><code><span class="syntax-purple">def</span> <span class="syntax-blue">prepare_data</span>(data):</code></div>\r\n                      <div><span class="why-school-code-number">4</span><code>    array = np.<span class="syntax-blue">array</span>(data)</code></div>\r\n                      <div><span class="why-school-code-number">5</span><code>    <span class="syntax-purple">return</span> array.<span class="syntax-blue">reshape</span>(<span class="syntax-orange">1</span>, -<span class="syntax-orange">1</span>)</code></div>\r\n                      <div><span class="why-school-code-number">6</span><code> </code></div>\r\n                      <div><span class="why-school-code-number">7</span><code>features = <span class="syntax-blue">prepare_data</span>(sample)</code></div>\r\n                      <div><span class="why-school-code-number">8</span><code>result = model.<span class="syntax-blue">predict</span>(features)</code></div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class="why-school-code-status"><span>Python</span><span>UTF-8 · main</span></div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                </div><div class="why-school-monitor-base"></div>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </article>\r\n            <article class="why-school-card why-school-card--career">\r\n              <span class="why-school-card-category">단계별 취·창업 지원</span><h4>취업부터 창업까지,<br>다음 도전도 함께</h4><p>1:1 취업 컨설팅부터 기업 모의면접, 채용박람회까지. 준비 단계에 맞춰 필요한 도움을 받고, 취업·창업을 차근차근 준비해요.</p>\r\n              <div class="why-school-visual why-school-visual--career" aria-hidden="true">\r\n                <div class="why-school-career-viewport">\r\n                  <div class="why-school-stack-track">\r\n                    <div class="why-school-stack-group">\r\n                      <span class="why-school-career-tile"><span class="why-school-resource-icon why-school-career-icon why-school-career-icon--0"></span><span>1:1 상담</span></span>\r\n                      <span class="why-school-career-tile"><span class="why-school-resource-icon why-school-career-icon why-school-career-icon--1"></span><span>모의면접</span></span>\r\n                      <span class="why-school-career-tile"><span class="why-school-resource-icon why-school-career-icon why-school-career-icon--2"></span><span>이력서</span></span>\r\n                      <span class="why-school-career-tile"><span class="why-school-resource-icon why-school-career-icon why-school-career-icon--3"></span><span>포트폴리오</span></span>\r\n                      <span class="why-school-career-tile"><span class="why-school-resource-icon why-school-career-icon why-school-career-icon--4"></span><span>채용박람회</span></span>\r\n                      <span class="why-school-career-tile"><span class="why-school-resource-icon why-school-career-icon why-school-career-icon--5"></span><span>창업 준비</span></span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class="why-school-stack-group">\r\n                      <span class="why-school-career-tile"><span class="why-school-resource-icon why-school-career-icon why-school-career-icon--0"></span><span>1:1 상담</span></span>\r\n                      <span class="why-school-career-tile"><span class="why-school-resource-icon why-school-career-icon why-school-career-icon--1"></span><span>모의면접</span></span>\r\n                      <span class="why-school-career-tile"><span class="why-school-resource-icon why-school-career-icon why-school-career-icon--2"></span><span>이력서</span></span>\r\n                      <span class="why-school-career-tile"><span class="why-school-resource-icon why-school-career-icon why-school-career-icon--3"></span><span>포트폴리오</span></span>\r\n                      <span class="why-school-career-tile"><span class="why-school-resource-icon why-school-career-icon why-school-career-icon--4"></span><span>채용박람회</span></span>\r\n                      <span class="why-school-career-tile"><span class="why-school-resource-icon why-school-career-icon why-school-career-icon--5"></span><span>창업 준비</span></span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class="why-school-stack-group">\r\n                      <span class="why-school-career-tile"><span class="why-school-resource-icon why-school-career-icon why-school-career-icon--0"></span><span>1:1 상담</span></span>\r\n                      <span class="why-school-career-tile"><span class="why-school-resource-icon why-school-career-icon why-school-career-icon--1"></span><span>모의면접</span></span>\r\n                      <span class="why-school-career-tile"><span class="why-school-resource-icon why-school-career-icon why-school-career-icon--2"></span><span>이력서</span></span>\r\n                      <span class="why-school-career-tile"><span class="why-school-resource-icon why-school-career-icon why-school-career-icon--3"></span><span>포트폴리오</span></span>\r\n                      <span class="why-school-career-tile"><span class="why-school-resource-icon why-school-career-icon why-school-career-icon--4"></span><span>채용박람회</span></span>\r\n                      <span class="why-school-career-tile"><span class="why-school-resource-icon why-school-career-icon why-school-career-icon--5"></span><span>창업 준비</span></span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class="why-school-stack-group">\r\n                      <span class="why-school-career-tile"><span class="why-school-resource-icon why-school-career-icon why-school-career-icon--0"></span><span>1:1 상담</span></span>\r\n                      <span class="why-school-career-tile"><span class="why-school-resource-icon why-school-career-icon why-school-career-icon--1"></span><span>모의면접</span></span>\r\n                      <span class="why-school-career-tile"><span class="why-school-resource-icon why-school-career-icon why-school-career-icon--2"></span><span>이력서</span></span>\r\n                      <span class="why-school-career-tile"><span class="why-school-resource-icon why-school-career-icon why-school-career-icon--3"></span><span>포트폴리오</span></span>\r\n                      <span class="why-school-career-tile"><span class="why-school-resource-icon why-school-career-icon why-school-career-icon--4"></span><span>채용박람회</span></span>\r\n                      <span class="why-school-career-tile"><span class="why-school-resource-icon why-school-career-icon why-school-career-icon--5"></span><span>창업 준비</span></span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </article>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </section>\r\n      </section>\r\n      <section id="learning" class="common-courses" aria-labelledby="learning-heading">\r\n        <svg class="common-course-symbols" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">\r\n          <defs>\r\n            <symbol id="course-idea" viewBox="0 0 88 88"><path d="M24 36a20 20 0 1 1 40 0c0 11-11 15-11 26H35c0-11-11-15-11-26Z" fill="#244cd2"/><path d="M35 63h18v8H35zM39 75h10v5H39z" fill="#17223b"/><path d="m44 29-9 14h9l-3 11 13-17H44l5-8Z" fill="#ffc145"/><path d="M44 2v8M12 13l7 7M3 37h10M76 13l-7 7M75 37h10" stroke="#17223b" stroke-width="4"/></symbol>\r\n            <symbol id="course-user" viewBox="0 0 88 88"><circle cx="28" cy="26" r="13" fill="#244cd2"/><path d="M8 75V58a20 20 0 0 1 40 0v17Z" fill="#17223b"/><path d="M55 17h26v55H55z" fill="#fff"/><path d="M60 28h15M60 39h15M60 50h9" stroke="#244cd2" stroke-width="4"/><circle cx="47" cy="57" r="13" fill="#ffc145"/><path d="m40 57 5 5 9-10" fill="none" stroke="#17223b" stroke-width="4"/></symbol>\r\n            <symbol id="course-layout" viewBox="0 0 88 88"><path d="M6 13h76v61H6z" fill="#17223b"/><path d="M12 19h64v49H12z" fill="#fff"/><path d="M12 19h64v10H12z" fill="#244cd2"/><path d="M18 36h21v24H18z" fill="#ffc145"/><path d="M46 36h24v5H46zM46 46h24v5H46zM46 56h17v4H46z" fill="#d2d9eb"/><path d="m57 58 18 17-10 1-5 10Z" fill="#244cd2"/></symbol>\r\n            <symbol id="course-api" viewBox="0 0 88 88"><path d="M10 26h22v36H10zM56 26h22v36H56z" fill="#17223b"/><path d="M32 37h24v14H32z" fill="#244cd2"/><path d="M17 18v10M25 18v10M63 60v11M71 60v11" stroke="#17223b" stroke-width="4"/><path d="m41 26-7 14h11l-3 22 13-28H44l4-8Z" fill="#ffc145"/></symbol>\r\n            <symbol id="course-prototype" viewBox="0 0 88 88"><path d="M7 12h74v53H7z" fill="#17223b"/><path d="M13 18h62v41H13z" fill="#fff"/><path d="M15 20h58v8H15zM35 65h18v10H35zM23 75h42v5H23z" fill="#244cd2"/><path d="M21 39h8v13h-8zM35 34h8v18h-8z" fill="#ffc145"/><path d="M49 32h17v4H49zM49 40h17v4H49zM49 48h12v4H49z" fill="#d2d9eb"/></symbol>\r\n            <symbol id="course-chat" viewBox="0 0 88 88"><path d="M9 13h62v42H34L17 71V55H9Z" fill="#244cd2"/><path d="M40 48h40v26H67l-1 11-11-11H40Z" fill="#ffc145"/><circle cx="25" cy="33" r="4" fill="#fff"/><circle cx="40" cy="33" r="4" fill="#fff"/><circle cx="55" cy="33" r="4" fill="#fff"/><path d="M48 58h23v4H48zM48 65h16v4H48z" fill="#17223b"/></symbol>\r\n            <symbol id="course-business" viewBox="0 0 88 88"><path d="M8 72h72v7H8zM14 48h14v24H14zM36 33h14v39H36z" fill="#17223b"/><path d="M58 17h14v55H58z" fill="#244cd2"/><path d="m13 32 25-17 12 6L71 5M58 5h14v14" fill="none" stroke="#ffc145" stroke-width="5"/></symbol>\r\n            <symbol id="course-data" viewBox="0 0 88 88"><path d="M8 24v40c0 15 47 15 47 0V24Z" fill="#17223b"/><ellipse cx="31.5" cy="24" rx="23.5" ry="10" fill="#244cd2"/><path d="M8 43c0 13 47 13 47 0M8 58c0 13 47 13 47 0" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="65" cy="58" r="19" fill="#ffc145"/><path d="M59 47h9M62 47v23M69 50c-13-8-15 11-4 9 12-1 10 18-4 10" fill="none" stroke="#17223b" stroke-width="3"/></symbol>\r\n            <symbol id="course-agent" viewBox="0 0 88 88"><rect x="7" y="20" width="66" height="51" rx="4" fill="#17223b"/><path d="M12 32h56v34H12z" fill="#fff"/><circle cx="15" cy="26" r="2" fill="#ffc145"/><circle cx="22" cy="26" r="2" fill="#93b9ff"/><path d="m29 41-9 8 9 8m23-16 9 8-9 8M44 39l-8 21" fill="none" stroke="#244cd2" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="m73 7 4 10 10 4-10 4-4 10-4-10-10-4 10-4z" fill="#ffc145"/></symbol>\r\n            <symbol id="course-pitch" viewBox="0 0 88 88"><path d="M8 32h20v26H8z" fill="#17223b"/><path d="m28 32 43-17v60L28 58Z" fill="#fff"/><path d="M25 56h13l7 25H31zM73 32l12 7v12l-12 7Z" fill="#17223b"/><path d="M49 24 71 15v60l-22-9Z" fill="#244cd2"/><circle cx="20" cy="17" r="8" fill="#ffc145"/></symbol>\r\n          </defs>\r\n        </svg>\r\n        <div class="common-courses-wrap about-wrap">\r\n          <header class="common-courses-heading">\r\n            <h2 id="learning-heading">무엇을 배우나요?</h2>\r\n            <p>AI 서비스를 기획하고, 직접 만들고 발표하는 과정을 함께 배워요.</p>\r\n            <div class="common-courses-meta"><span>2026년 7기 교육 기준</span><strong>공통 교과목 · 총 80시간</strong></div>\r\n          </header>\r\n          <ul class="common-courses-grid" aria-label="공통 교과목의 열 가지 학습 주제">\r\n            <li class="common-course-card"><img class="common-course-icon" src="assets/courses/idea-clay.png" alt="" width="1024" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div class="common-course-caption"><h3>AI 트렌드· 문제 정의</h3><p>기술의 한계 · 해결할 문제</p></div></li>\r\n            <li class="common-course-card"><img class="common-course-icon" src="assets/courses/user-clay.png" alt="" width="1024" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div class="common-course-caption"><h3>사용자· 요구사항</h3><p>페르소나 · PRD · 핵심 기능</p></div></li>\r\n            <li class="common-course-card"><img class="common-course-icon" src="assets/courses/layout-clay.png" alt="" width="1024" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div class="common-course-caption"><h3>UI/UX 화면 설계</h3><p>Figma · 와이어프레임</p></div></li>\r\n            <li class="common-course-card"><img class="common-course-icon" src="assets/courses/api-clay.png" alt="" width="1024" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div class="common-course-caption"><h3>프롬프트· API 연동</h3><p>OpenAI · Claude</p></div></li>\r\n            <li class="common-course-card"><img class="common-course-icon" src="assets/courses/prototype-clay.png" alt="" width="1024" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div class="common-course-caption"><h3>AI 프로토타입</h3><p>Streamlit · 웹 대시보드</p></div></li>\r\n            <li class="common-course-card"><img class="common-course-icon" src="assets/courses/agent-clay.png" alt="" width="1024" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div class="common-course-caption"><h3>AI 코딩 에이전트</h3><p>Cursor · Windsurf</p></div></li>\r\n            <li class="common-course-card"><img class="common-course-icon" src="assets/courses/chat-clay.png" alt="" width="1024" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div class="common-course-caption"><h3>노코드· AI 챗봇</h3><p>Bubble · 응용 서비스</p></div></li>\r\n            <li class="common-course-card"><img class="common-course-icon" src="assets/courses/business-clay.png" alt="" width="1024" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div class="common-course-caption"><h3>비즈니스 모델</h3><p>린 캔버스 · 수익 구조</p></div></li>\r\n            <li class="common-course-card"><img class="common-course-icon" src="assets/courses/data-clay.png" alt="" width="1024" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div class="common-course-caption"><h3>데이터· 비용 분석</h3><p>데이터 확보 · ROI</p></div></li>\r\n            <li class="common-course-card common-course-card--project"><img class="common-course-icon" src="assets/courses/project-clay.png" alt="" width="1024" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div class="common-course-caption"><h3>최종 프로젝트</h3><p>기획 · 구현 · 성과 발표</p></div></li>\r\n          </ul>\r\n          <section id="education-hours" class="education-hours" aria-labelledby="education-hours-heading">\r\n            <header class="education-hours-heading">\r\n              <div class="education-hours-heading-copy">\r\n              <span class="micro-label">교육 시간</span>\r\n              <h3 id="education-hours-heading"><span>기초를 다지고,</span> 프로젝트로 이어가요.</h3>\r\n              <span class="education-hours-year">2026년 7기 교육 기준</span>\r\n              </div>\r\n              <div class="education-hours-summary"><div class="education-hours-stat"><span>전체 교육 시간</span><strong><span class="education-hours-number" data-count-to="1300" aria-hidden="true">1,300</span><span class="education-hours-number-label">1,300</span><small>시간</small></strong></div></div>\r\n            </header>\r\n            <ol class="education-time-stages" aria-label="준비·성장·도약, 세 단계의 교육 과정">\r\n              <li class="education-phase-prep">\r\n                <div class="education-phase-top"><span class="education-phase-step">STEP 1</span></div>\r\n                <div class="education-phase-band"><h4>AI 준비과정</h4></div>\r\n                <div class="education-phase-body"><p>온라인 VOD로 AI 기초를 배워요. 본격적인 수업에 앞서 필요한 기초를 차근차근 익혀요.</p></div>\r\n                <div class="education-phase-photo education-phase-photo--browser"><div class="education-browser-toolbar" aria-hidden="true"><span class="education-browser-lights"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="education-browser-navigation"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="m12 5-5 5 5 5"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="m8 5 5 5-5 5"/></svg></span><span class="education-browser-address"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><rect x="4" y="7" width="8" height="6" rx="1.5"/><path d="M5.5 7V5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0v2"/></svg>AI 온라인 클래스</span><span class="education-browser-share"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M6 8H4v9h12V8h-2M10 12V2m-3 3 3-3 3 3"/></svg></span></div><div class="education-browser-viewport"><img src="assets/education/online-class-screen-generated.png" alt="참여자 영상과 AI 기초 수업 자료가 보이는 온라인 강의 화면" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></div>\r\n              </li>\r\n              <li class="education-phase-growth">\r\n                <div class="education-phase-top"><span class="education-phase-step">STEP 2</span></div>\r\n                <div class="education-phase-band"><h4>AI 성장과정</h4></div>\r\n                <div class="education-phase-body"><p>공통 수업을 듣고, 선택한 직군과 산업 분야에 맞는 내용을 더 배워요.</p></div>\r\n                <div class="education-phase-photo"><img src="assets/education/classroom-lesson-generated.png" alt="교실에서 강사의 설명을 들으며 AI 실습 수업에 참여하는 교육생들" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>\r\n              </li>\r\n              <li class="education-phase-project">\r\n                <div class="education-phase-top"><span class="education-phase-step">STEP 3</span></div>\r\n                <div class="education-phase-band"><h4>AI 도약과정</h4></div>\r\n                <div class="education-phase-body"><p>기업 연계·창업·실증 프로젝트 중 하나를 선택해 팀과 함께해요. AX 프로젝트를 만들어 봐요.</p></div>\r\n                <div class="education-phase-photo"><img src="assets/school/intro-team-discussion.png" alt="노트북을 펼쳐 놓고 의견을 나누는 팀원들" width="1672" height="941" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>\r\n              </li>\r\n            </ol>\r\n          </section>\r\n          <section id="daily-routine" class="daily-routine" aria-labelledby="daily-routine-heading">\r\n            <header class="daily-routine-heading"><span class="micro-label">운영 방식</span><h3 id="daily-routine-heading">아침 9시부터 오후 6시까지.</h3><p>2026년 7기 · 평일 대면 교육 기준</p></header>\r\n            <div class="daily-routine-board">\r\n              <div class="daily-routine-board-top"><span class="daily-routine-week">월요일부터 금요일까지</span><ul class="daily-routine-weekdays" aria-label="수업 요일"><li>월</li><li>화</li><li>수</li><li>목</li><li>금</li></ul></div>\r\n              <div class="daily-routine-day-range"><div><span>등교·수업 시작</span><strong><time datetime="09:00">09:00</time></strong></div><div class="daily-routine-day-connector" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none"><path d="M8 20h24m-8-8 8 8-8 8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span></span></div><div><span>수업 종료·하교</span><strong><time datetime="18:00">18:00</time></strong></div></div>\r\n              <div class="daily-routine-track" aria-hidden="true"><div class="daily-routine-track-morning"><span>오전 수업</span></div><div class="daily-routine-track-lunch"><span>점심·휴식</span></div><div class="daily-routine-track-afternoon"><span>오후 수업·실습</span></div></div>\r\n              <ol class="daily-routine-agenda" aria-label="하루 수업과 점심시간">\r\n                <li class="daily-routine-morning"><div class="daily-routine-agenda-top"><span class="daily-routine-step-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 6c-3-2-6-2-9-1v14c3-1 6-1 9 1 3-2 6-2 9-1V5c-3-1-6-1-9 1Zm0 0v14M6 9h3m-3 4h3m6-4h3m-3 4h3"/></svg></span><span class="daily-routine-period">오전</span></div><div class="daily-routine-time"><time datetime="09:00">09:00</time><span>–</span><time datetime="11:50">11:50</time></div><h4>배우고, 질문하며</h4><p>시간표에 맞춰 이론을 배우거나 실습해요. 궁금한 건 강사에게 물어보면서 정리해 봐요.</p></li>\r\n                <li class="daily-routine-lunch"><div class="daily-routine-agenda-top"><span class="daily-routine-step-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 3v6m3-6v6M2 3v6c0 3 6 3 6 0M5 12v9M18 3c-4 3-4 9 0 9h2V3Zm2 9v9"/></svg></span><span class="daily-routine-period">점심·휴식</span></div><div class="daily-routine-time"><time datetime="11:50">11:50</time><span>–</span><time datetime="13:00">13:00</time></div><h4>잠깐 쉬어가기</h4><p>점심을 먹고 잠깐 쉬어 가요. 오후 수업은 13시에 시작해요.</p></li>\r\n                <li class="daily-routine-afternoon"><div class="daily-routine-agenda-top"><span class="daily-routine-step-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 4h16v12H4zM2 20h20M9 16l-1 4m7-4 1 4m-6-9-2-2 2-2m4 0 2 2-2 2"/></svg></span><span class="daily-routine-period">오후</span></div><div class="daily-routine-time"><time datetime="13:00">13:00</time><span>–</span><time datetime="18:00">18:00</time></div><h4>직접 해보며 익혀요</h4><p>수업과 실습을 이어가요. 교육과정에 따라 팀 활동이나 프로젝트도 함께해요.</p></li>\r\n              </ol>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </section>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </section>\r\n      <section id="activities" class="guest-lecture" aria-labelledby="activities-heading">\r\n        <div class="guest-lecture-wrap">\r\n          <header class="guest-lecture-heading"><h2 id="activities-heading">어떤 활동을 하나요?</h2><p>팀 프로젝트로 직접 만들고, 다양한 활동에서 경험을 넓혀요.</p></header>\r\n          <section class="activity-projects" aria-labelledby="activity-projects-heading">\r\n            <div class="activity-project-confetti activity-project-confetti--left" aria-hidden="true"><i class="activity-project-particle activity-project-particle--ribbon export-style-1"></i><i class="activity-project-particle export-style-2"></i><i class="activity-project-particle export-style-3"></i><i class="activity-project-particle activity-project-particle--ribbon export-style-4"></i><i class="activity-project-particle export-style-5"></i><i class="activity-project-particle export-style-6"></i><i class="activity-project-particle activity-project-particle--ribbon export-style-7"></i><i class="activity-project-particle export-style-8"></i><i class="activity-project-particle export-style-9"></i><i class="activity-project-particle activity-project-particle--ribbon export-style-10"></i><i class="activity-project-particle export-style-11"></i><i class="activity-project-particle export-style-12"></i></div>\r\n            <div class="activity-project-confetti acti